      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "11",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kalombele ako kigeleelilwe",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ikanza ilebe ū Yesu walī hanhū akūlombaga, aho wamala ū kūlomba ūmò o bahemba bakwe ūng'wīla gīkī, “Seeba tūlangage nise ū kūlomba gīt'ūmo Yohana akabalangīla bahemba bakwe.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna ūbawīla, “Ūlū mulīlomba mulahayage gīkī,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha numa ya henaho ūbawīla gīkī, “Ī gīsī gemelagi ūlū ūmò wing'we alī na nwani ng'wiye wiza kūnugūja būjikū ha gatī ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ng'wanong'wise nigunanhage migatī idatū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Napandīka ngeni, nwani ng'wichane wafuma mu lūgendo; alīyo ī haha natī na shilīwa sha kūntengela!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ūyo alī mu gatī ashikile kūnshokeja ūng'wīla gīkī, ‘Ūtanikoyage namalaga kūpagīja ū lwigī; nīyo a baana bane pyī nū nene tūlī mu būlīīlī twalaalaga; ī haha natūdūla ū kūbūūka, nūūlū kūkwinha shose shose!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nalīmuwīla atūdūla ng'hana ū kūbūūka ang'winhe nūūlū īkī nwani ng'wiye. Alīyo kūlwa kalombele ka lūgūūmī, akūnoga nose abūūke ang'winhe; nīyo akūng'winha kūlenganīla na a kalombele kakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna lūūlū nalīmuwīla lombagi mukwinhwa, koobagi mukūpandīka, tūlagi hoodi ha nyango mukūlugūlīlwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno būlī ng'wene ūyo akalombaga akinhagwa, nū yūyo akakoobaga akapandīkaga, hama nū yūyo akatūlaga hoodi ha nyango akalugūlīlagwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Angū, alīho myaji kī ū mu bing'we ūyo ashikile kūlomva ndīlo na ng'wanokwe, nang'hwe ūng'winha nzoka a ha ng'wanya go ndīlo? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nūūlū hamo ūlomva igī, nani ūyo adūgije kūng'winha ng'homi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, manīlagi henaho; a bing'we nūūlū īkī mulī babūbi, nahene mumanile ū kūbinha a baana bing'we shikolo shawiza. Ū Sīng'we ūyo alī ng'wigūlū, atīīta yawiza kūtinda a bing'we? Nguno ū ng'wene akūbinha Moyo Ng'wela abo bakūnombaga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yesu na Belizebuli",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lūshikū lūngī akang'wīngīja munhū isamva lya būshimuumu; aho lyamfuma ū munhū ng'wenūyo ūdūla ū kūyomba. A banhū abo baalīho būkumya no. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwike bamò babo bandya kūhaya gīkī, “A masamva akūgapeejaga kūlwa būdūla bo Lībelizebuli, ī litaale lya masamva.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bangī būyūngema, kūnū balīkooba shimanīkījo sha kūfuma ng'wigūlū kwīngīīla kūlī we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Yesu īkī walī agamanile a maganiko gabo, ūbawīla gīkī, “Būlī būtemi ūlū būgabanīka hūna wandya kwilwisha boi wenekīlī na wenekīlī, būkwimala. Nūūlū kaya ūlū yandya kwiyūbūkīla yoi yenekīlī īkūgwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A bing'we mulīhaya gīkī ū nene nakūgapeejaga a masamva mu būdūla bo ng'wa Belizebuli, angū numho hū kūhaya ū Shetani ogabanīkile. Hama būkwīmīīla ginehe lūūlū ū būtemi bokwe? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo hangī, ū nene ūlū nakūgapeejaga a masamva mu būdūla bo ng'wa Belizebuli, al'a baana bing'we, a bene bakagapeejaga mu būdūla kī? Na lūūlū managi gīkī, a benabo bakūbiza balamuji bing'we! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū nakūgapeejaga a masamva mu būdūla bo nkono go ng'wa Mulungu, managi gīkī ū būtemi bo ng'wa Mulungu bong'wizīīlile! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū munhū o nguzu ūlū adimile shilanga akūlang'hanaga kaya yakwe, ī shikolo shakwe shilī mhola. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ūlū wiza munhū o nguzu kūtinda ū wei, hūna ūndumīla ūng'heeba, akūntaaja pyī ī shilanga shakwe īsho ashisanije, hanuma ī shikolo shakwe ūshisola ūshigabanhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ūyo atī hamò na nene alī ng'wilwisha wane, nū yūyo atūkumingaga hamò nane akūbbalasanyaga!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūshoka kwa moyo nsoso",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ū moyo nsoso ūlū gūmfuma munhū, gūkajaga ūko na ūko gūkūhūhūūlījaga mu matogolo makalamuku gatī na minzī, gūlīkooba ha kwifuulīla. Ūlū gūgayiwa gūkahayaga gīkī, ‘ī gete nashoke ū kū numba yane ūmo naafumile!’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gwakūhayiza, gwīsanga īpyagūlilwe, na kūgaliilwa chiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hūna gūja kūjūsoleleja myoyo yīngī mpungatī misoso kūgūheeba ū goyi, gwiza nayo; pyī yingīla yikala mo. Ī ng'halīlo ya ng'wa munhū ng'wenūyo īkabizaga yabūbi no, kūtinda ūmo walī ī kwandya!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "A badīlīji balī na lubango",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho wakalīcha ū kūhaya pyī ī yose īyī, nkīma nebe ū ng'wibita ūhamuka n'ilaka lya higūlya ūng'wīla gīkī “Īlī na lubango ī nda īyo īkakūbūūcha, nī mbeele ījo ūkajong'ha najo jilī na lubango!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūhaya, “Ūlītūngīlīja alīyo ī no no no abo balī na lubango, balī abo bakūgwigwaga ū mhayo go ng'wa Mulungu bagūdīlīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Kūkooba shimanīkījo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A mabita aho gongeja kūng'okalīīla, ūhaya gīkī, “Ī shibyalīlwe īshi shabūbi no; shikūkoobaga shimanīkījo, alīyo shitinhwa shimanīkījo, ūlū ītī sha ng'wa Yona dūhū! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nguno gīt'ūmo Yona walī shimanīkījo kū banhū ba Ninawi, h'ūmo akūbizīla nū Ng'wana wa Munhū ū kū banhū ba shibyalīlwe īshi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū ng'wikanza lya kūlamulwa, ū ntemi nkīma wa sī ya dakama akwīmīīla nabo a banhū ba shibyalīlwe īshi abenheleje kwinhwa nsango. Nguno ū ng'wene akafuma kū sī ya kūle wiza kūlī Solomoni kūdegeleka mihayo yakwe ya masala, alīyo ī haha ūyo alīho aha ng'wene ntaale kūtinda Solomoni. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na a banhū ba Ninawi bakwīmīīla nabo a banhū ba shibyalīlwe īshi, ū ng'wikanza lya kūlamulwa, babenheleje kwinhwa nsango. Nguno a bene aho bawigwa ū būlomeeji bo ng'wa Yona bakagalūka; alīyo ī haha ūyo alīho aha ng'wene ntaale kūtinda Yona.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Isana lya mīlī",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Atīho munhū wa kūbacha tala hūna wakītūūla kwibisu, nūūlū wīkundīkīja itangwa. Īkatūūlagwa h'ikīndīkīlo lya tala, gīkī bayūlībona ī lisana lyayo abo balingīla ū mu numba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ī tala ya mīlī līlī liso lyako; ī liso lyako ūlū līlī mhola, numho pyī ū mīlī gwako gūlī n'isana. Alīyo ī liso lyako ūlū lyūpandīka kaagede, ū mīlī gwako gūkūbiza mu giiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ali lūūlū, ilang'hanage, ī lisana īlo ūlī nalyo lītizūgalūka kūbiza giiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nīyo ū mīlī gwako ūlū gūlī ng'wisana, gūbiza gūtī na giiti nūūlū hado, pyī ū gose gūkūbiza n'isana gīt'ūmo īkabizīlaga tala ūlū īlīkūtiimīla.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.36"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Koolomiwa Bafalisayo na balangi ba shilagīlo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū Yesu aho wamala ū kūsomboola ī yenīyo, Mfalisayo nebe ūng'wegeleja gīkī ize alye nang'hwe shilīwa ha ng'wakwe; na ng'hana wingīla wigasha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alīyo ū Mfalisayo ng'wenūyo akakumya no ū kūbona gīkī ū Yesu oleka ū kūkalaba tame aho ataalī kwandya ū kūlya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Seeba ūng'wīla gīkī, “A bing'we Bafalisayo mulī na makoye, nguno mukiyoogelelejaga higūlya gūlya, gītī kooja shikombe na mabakuli, alīyo ū mu gatī ng'okalile wibi na būnyeecha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we bachilū chilū, ū meeja washo ī sha hanze atī hū ng'wene ū meeja washo nī sha mu gatī? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shifunyagi tame ī sha mu gatī shibize manong'ho, hū shikūmubeelela pyī ī shikolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hangī nīyo mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we Bafalisayo, nguno mukafunyaga īmò ya ng'wikūmi ya shikolo shido do do, gītī shisanjo sha mu shilīwa na madūūtū ga mbika ījo na ījo! Alīyo ī mihayo ya būtūngīlīja na būtogwa bo ng'wa Mulungu mukīkīlanhyaga! Shing'wigeleelilwe kwīshikīlīja ī yenīyī, alīyo nī yīngī yaya ū kwīleka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bing'we Bafalisayo mulī mu kwihīga, nguno mutogilwe kwigasīja masumbī g'ikūjo mu masinagogi, na kwikala mulīgīshiwa mu magūlilū. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga, nguno mubizile gītī shigila īsho shijimīlīkanile, īsho banhū bakabītaga higūlya yasho nū kūdeeba yaya!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kūhayimanīla ūmò wa balangi ba shilagīlo wanshokeja alīhaya gīkī, “Nangi īyo ūkwīhayaga yenīyo na a bise ūlītūdūkanīja mo!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nang'hwe ū Yesu ūnshokeja ūng'wīla, “Angū na a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo mulī mu kwihīga, nguno mukasesejaga banhū miligo midito kū mabega, alīyo a bing'we benekīlī mutagemaga ū kūtūūla ho nūūlū lwala lwing'we lūmò kūbagunanha. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga, nguno mukazengeelaga shigila sha bahangi; abo babūlagwa na bakūlūgenji bing'we. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.47"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "48",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:48"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "48",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hū kūhaya mukikaanīlaga bing'we benekīlī, na kwizunīlīja nī shītwa sha bakūlūgenji bing'we, nguno a bene bababūlaga, lelo a bing'we mukūshizengeelaga ī shigila shabo! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.48",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.48"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "49",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:49"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "49",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "H'ī nguno yene ū Mulungu nang'hwe ū mu masala gakwe ahayile gīkī, ‘Nakūbatūmīla bahangi na batūng'wa; bakūyūbabūlaga bamò babo, na bangī bakūbaluhya. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.49",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.49"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "50",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:50"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "50",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ū mu gīko gakūkoowa kūfuma mu shibyalīlwe īshi pye a mininga ga bahangi ayo gidīka; kwīngīīla ikanza lya kūseeng'wa kwa sī. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.50",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.50"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "51",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:51"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "51",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwandīja mininga ga ng'wa Abeli kwiza kūkaja kū ga ng'wa Zakalia ūyo akabūlagīlwa mu hekalu kū būtongi bo ng'walīlo. Alichene, nalīmuwīla gakūkoowa ū mu shibyalīlwe īshi.’ ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.51",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.51"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "52",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:52"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "52",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mulī mu kwihīga a bing'we balangi ba shilagīlo, nguno mulūdimile ū lūfungūlo lwa būmani. A bing'we mulemeelilwe ū kwingīla, alīyo na a babo batogilwe ū kwingīla mukabahangījaga!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.52",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.52"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "53",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:53"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "53",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho alīnga a henaho a balangi ba shilagīlo na a Bafalisayo bandya kūmūgīlīja mihayo mingī, koolecha hape gīkī baalī bapelana no; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.53",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.53"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "54",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LUK 11:54"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "54",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kūnū bang'witegeelaga bapandīkīle ho nzīla ya kūngwasha mu kalūngalūngīle kakwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LUK.11.54",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LUK.11.54"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
